<section class="site-cookie-banner" data-consent-banner hidden aria-label="Cookie choices">
  <div><p>Optional analytics cookies help us measure page views and clicks toward SuperDoc. They stay off until you choose.</p><a href="/privacy">Privacy and cookie choices</a><p data-consent-signal hidden>Your browser privacy signal keeps optional analytics off.</p></div>
  <div class="site-cookie-actions"><button type="button" data-consent-accept>Accept analytics</button><button type="button" data-consent-reject>Reject analytics</button><button type="button" data-consent-open>Preferences</button></div>
</section>
<dialog class="site-cookie-dialog" data-consent-dialog aria-labelledby="site-cookie-title">
  <h2 id="site-cookie-title">Cookie preferences</h2>
  <p>Necessary storage saves your choice and supports essential site functions.</p>
  <label class="site-cookie-purpose"><input type="checkbox" data-consent-analytics /><span><strong>Optional analytics</strong><br />Google Analytics measures page views and referral clicks. You can use the site without enabling it.</span></label>
  <p data-consent-signal hidden>Your browser privacy signal keeps optional analytics off.</p>
  <p data-consent-reload hidden>Turning analytics off reloads this page. Save any edits before continuing.</p>
  <p><a href="/privacy">Privacy and cookie choices</a> · <a href="https://www.superdoc.dev/privacy-policy">SuperDoc privacy policy</a></p>
  <footer><button type="button" data-consent-reject>Reject analytics</button><button type="button" data-consent-save>Save choices</button><button type="button" data-consent-close>Close</button></footer>
</dialog>
